OL,3,GNEWSAEvacuated residents face second
OL,4,Anight away from home
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday, Rachel Hale, 35, appeared at
OL,7,FSheffield Magistrates' Court charged
OL,8,Fwith an offence under the Explosive
OL,9,FSubstances Act 1883 and was remanded in
OL,10,Fcustody.
OL,12,FSouth Yorkshire Police said it did not
OL,13,F"underestimate" the impact of the
OL,14,Fevacuation on residents and ordnance
OL,15,Fexperts would advise when it was safe
OL,16,Ffor them to return home.
